# Finish the job, then ask to publish

Complete the full job (implement, test, commit, push, PR). Railway deploys from `main` — a feature branch is not live.

Then ask the user to publish. Their shortcut is `pp`.

When they say `pp`: commit if needed, push, and merge the PR into `main` so Railway deploys. Do not ask for extra confirmation.
